to drive the scenarios.

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:36.360
Again, I just
wanted to reiterate,

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:39.046
for the web metadata, it really
depends if a similar image

00:14:39.046 --> 00:14:39.795
exists on the web.

00:14:39.795 --> 00:14:43.650
So if it's an object that's not
present on the external web,

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:46.500
you most probably will not
get any metadata on it.

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:47.820
I talked a lot about products.

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.560
But there are also other cases
where people are thinking

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:50.670
about furniture shopping.

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:52.440
People are thinking
