00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:57.700
So in this case, I
basically pinned up,

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:59.830
grabbed a bunch of images
from-- for example,

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:02.119
you have a for, potentially,
