00:34:02.800 --> 00:34:04.900
fundamental is product
reviews, right?

00:34:04.900 --> 00:34:06.790
You get this product
reviews galore.

00:34:06.790 --> 00:34:09.500
There are things that people are
talking about on social media.

00:34:09.500 --> 00:34:10.960
What are people saying
about my product?

00:34:10.960 --> 00:34:12.959
There are product reviews
coming from magazines,

00:34:12.959 --> 00:34:13.870
from publishers.

00:34:13.870 --> 00:34:14.770
Find my product.

00:34:14.770 --> 00:34:15.830
Tell me what's going on.

00:34:15.830 --> 00:34:17.530
Tell me what's relevant
for my product.

00:34:17.530 --> 00:34:19.489
What else are they
talking about?

00:34:19.489 --> 00:34:24.370
And the other aspects
is when you think about,

00:34:24.370 --> 00:34:25.790
when you look at
