00:34:32.000 --> 00:34:33.750
what other product are
they talking about?

00:34:33.750 --> 00:34:35.982
What other competitor
are they talking about?

00:34:35.982 --> 00:34:37.940
What else are they
associating my product with?

00:34:37.940 --> 00:34:39.773
That's really the thing
I just talked about.

00:34:39.773 --> 00:34:41.270
For example, suggest phones.

00:34:41.270 --> 00:34:43.439
For example, if I'm
