else are they talking about,

00:42:56.270 --> 00:42:58.103
so you can start building
relationship grabs

00:42:58.103 --> 00:43:00.347
with appropriate
level of sentiment.

00:43:00.347 --> 00:43:02.680
So that's really what I wanted
to cover in this session.

